        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>The sales effect of \"Free App of the Day\" on Amazon Appstore</title>\n<style>\n    body {\n        font-family: Arial, sans-serif;\n        margin: 0;\n        padding: 0;\n        color: #222;\n        line-height: 1.6;\n        background-color: #fff;\n    }\n    .header {\n        background-color: #d32f2f;\n        color: white;\n        padding: 60px 80px;\n    }\n    .header h1 {\n        font-size: 2.8em;\n        margin: 0 0 15px 0;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        line-height: 1.3;\n    }\n    .header h2 {\n        font-size: 1.8em;\n        margin: 0;\n        font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    .section-title {\n        color: #d32f2f;\n        text-transform: uppercase;\n        font-size: 1.4em;\n        font-weight: bold;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .top-section {\n        background-color: #f4f5f7;\n        padding: 50px 80px;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        align-items: center;\n    }\n    .top-left {\n        width: 65%;\n    }\n    .top-right {\n        width: 30%;\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: flex-end;\n    }\n    .placeholder {\n        background-color: #e0e0e0;\n        border: 2px dashed #999;\n        display: flex;\n        align-items: center;\n        justify-content: center;\n        text-align: center;\n        color: #555;\n        font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .img-placeholder {\n        width: 220px;\n        height: 280px;\n        border-radius: 10px;\n    }\n    .middle-section {\n        padding: 50px 80px;\n        display: flex;\n        gap: 60px;\n    }\n    .col-left {\n        flex: 1;\n        border-right: 1px solid #ddd;\n        padding-right: 60px;\n    }\n    .col-right {\n        flex: 1;\n    }\n    .list-item {\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    .list-item strong {\n        margin-right: 5px;\n    }\n    .sub-list {\n        margin-left: 20px;\n        margin-bottom: 15px;\n    }\n    .sub-list div {\n        margin-bottom: 5px;\n    }\n    table {\n        width: 100%;\n        border-collapse: collapse;\n        margin-top: 20px;\n        text-align: center;\n    }\n    th {\n        background-color: #d32f2f;\n        color: white;\n        padding: 12px;\n        font-weight: normal;\n    }\n    td {\n        padding: 10px;\n    }\n    .col-var {\n        background-color: #4db6ac;\n        color: white;\n        font-style: italic;\n    }\n    .col-val {\n        background-color: #f9f9f9;\n    }\n    .table-footer {\n        display: flex;\n        justify-content: space-between;\n        margin-top: 15px;\n        font-size: 0.9em;\n    }\n    .significance {\n        text-align: right;\n        font-style: italic;\n        line-height: 1.4;\n    }\n    .bottom-section {\n        padding: 0 80px 50px 80px;\n    }\n    .footer {\n        background-color: #000;\n        color: #fff;\n        padding: 40px 80px;\n        font-size: 1em;\n    }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n    <div class=\"header\">\n        <h1>The sales effect of “Free App of the Day”<br>on Amazon Appstore: An empirical study</h1>\n        <h2>Hong Chen, Kevin Lachaud, Wenqi Zhou</h2>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"top-section\">\n        <div class=\"top-left\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">INTRODUCTION</div>\n            <p>Apps, as an abbreviation of mobile applications, are software products for mobile platforms (Tang, 2016). They are designed to perform certain tasks on mobile devices (Islam, Islam, & Mazumder, 2010). This product category has grown to become a gigantic differentiated market with over 3.48 million apps on Google Play, an app marketplace, and the recent projection of over 935-billion-dollar revenue in 2023 (Statista Research, 2021a, Statista Research, 2021b).</p>\n            \n            <div class=\"section-title\" style=\"margin-top: 40px;\">OBJECTIVE</div>\n            <p>This work studies the adverse effect of “Free App of the Day” at Amazon Appstore.</p>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"top-right\">\n            <div class=\"placeholder img-placeholder\">[Illustration: 3D hand holding a smartphone with a smartwatch]</div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"middle-section\">\n        <div class=\"col-left\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">METHODOLOGY</div>\n            \n            <div class=\"list-item\"><strong>1.</strong> Literature review</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-list\">\n                <div>a. Digital free sampling</div>\n                <div>b. eWOM</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"list-item\"><strong>2.</strong> Hypotheses</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-list\">\n                <div>a. H1 - Online user decisions to adopt apps are discouraged by the price rebound after the zero-price offering of FAD ends. The sharper price rebound leads to a greater decrease in app adoptions.</div>\n                <div>b. H2 - Conditional on the total volume of eWOM, organic reviews are more influential to online user decisions of adopting apps than promotion-induced reviews after the FAD promotion ends.</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"list-item\"><strong>3.</strong> Data</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-list\">\n                <div>a. Context and data collection</div>\n                <div>b. Key variables</div>\n            </div>\n            \n            <div class=\"list-item\"><strong>4.</strong> Empirical analysis</div>\n            <div class=\"sub-list\">\n                <div>a. Exploratory analysis</div>\n                <div>b. Regression model and results</div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n        \n        <div class=\"col-right\">\n            <div class=\"section-title\">RESULTS</div>\n            <p>We notice that a few apps were off the direct spotlight post-promotion; however, they still offer zero price for another one or two days.</p>\n            <p>Specifically, an increase in SkewDailyi indicates a more right skewed distribution of daily number of reviews during the post-promotion period.</p>\n            \n            <table>\n                <thead>\n                    <tr>\n                        <th>Empty Cell</th>\n                        <th>Mean</th>\n                        <th>S.D.</th>\n                    </tr>\n                </thead>\n                <tbody>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">PriceReboundi,t</td><td class=\"col-val\">-0.40***</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.06</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">SkewDailyi</td><td class=\"col-val\">-0.19*</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.11</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">KurtDdailyi</td><td class=\"col-val\">-0.09**</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.05</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">Ln(NumReviewsi,t)</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.59***</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.08</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">AverageRatingi,t</td><td class=\"col-val\">2.06***</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.40</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">VarianceRatingi,t</td><td class=\"col-val\">1.17***</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.30</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">Dayi,t</td><td class=\"col-val\">-0.11*</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.03</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">Agei,t</td><td class=\"col-val\">-0.0004***</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.0002</td></tr>\n                    <tr><td class=\"col-var\">AppSizei,t</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.01***</td><td class=\"col-val\">0.002</td></tr>\n                </tbody>\n            </table>\n            \n            <div class=\"table-footer\">\n                <div><i>R2</i> = 0.45</div>\n                <div class=\"significance\">\n                    * p &lt; 0.1.<br>\n                    ** p &lt; 0.05.<br>\n                    *** p &lt; 0.01.\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"bottom-section\">\n        <div class=\"section-title\">CONCLUSION</div>\n        <p>We conclude that these promotion-induced reviews are less influential than organic reviews.</p>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer\">\n        <strong>References:</strong> Chen, H., Lachaud, K. and Zhou, W., 2022. The sales effect of “Free App of the Day” on Amazon Appstore: An empirical study. Digital Business, 2(2), p.100020.\n    </div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
